  "prepared_at_utc": "2026-10-21T02:09:20+00:00",
  "changes": [
    "Add default-OFF host MP-only Feuer toggle tied to effective MP scope restriction; auto-display original masked native button at permitted scopes/UZO independently of reports; retain native MP icon hiding/fire dispatch; scoped close cleanup; raise Feuer to 96 canvas units; TRC9 host flag. Clarify config-file comments and Dusty menu help for host setup, solo behavior and peer version requirements; no gameplay/protocol change in this help revision."
  ],
  "validation": {
    "compile": "passed",
    "offline": "passed",
    "in_game": "not-run",
    "notes": [
      "Configuration-help revision: configuration/provider suite re-run (65 checks) and full supplied-game reference compilation passed; unchanged suites retain 864 total offline assertions, including 50 actual MP display-adapter/layout checks and rollback after optional patch failure. Native UI and supplied MP 1.11.5 source paths inspected; no new live rendering, firing or network test. Copyright/license/credits preserved."
    ]
  },
  "known_issues": [
    "New MP host/client, join/leave, scope/UZO target/station transitions and higher Feuer placement need live testing. Prior .20 periscope Read-only/Hidden firing was reported successful; aft/TDC/bridge tests remain pending. All peers require .21/TRC9; supplied MP 1.11.5 supported. No new release/tag/Workshop publication; retain assigned Workshop ID/preview."
  ],
